      "value": [
        "Exactly one explicitly selected locked package:flib component; selected and reachable local packages require build-type Simple.",
        "Native Linux only; Darwin and cross compilation unsupported for these projections.",
        "Explicit C exports include distinct package-supplied init and term functions; process-once GHC runtime lifecycle and one foreign thread.",
